  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#947;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>be</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>an</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>image</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Q</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo></math>then<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>S</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math> and</p><p>point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>)</mo></math> lies on the plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>put the points of R&nbsp;in equation of plane anf find the value<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#38;</mi><mi>S</mi><mo>(</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>using distance formula find</p><p>distance of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>36</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>36</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">&#8658;</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>S</mi><mi>R</mi><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p>"
